{{!-- Reply template for the script-showcase flow. Echoes the variables the two scriptTasks
   merged into instance state: autoApprove is a typed boolean, correlationId is the FIRST script's
   {{uuid}} render, and correlationEcho is the SECOND script re-reading it — script building on a prior
   script's state. Strict rendering: any missing variable fails the render (deliberate). --}}
<ScriptShowcase autoApprove="{{autoApprove}}" correlationId="{{correlationId}}" correlationEcho="{{correlationEcho}}" engines="{{scriptEngine}}+{{scriptEngine2}}"/>